<div class="content"><div class="container-fluid">
<div class="mc-page-header"><div><h1 class="mc-page-title">Monthly Report</h1><p class="mc-page-subtitle">Rekap per hari untuk satu bulan, tetap menggunakan export Excel lama.</p></div><div class="mc-page-actions"><a id="mExport" href="#" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="mdi mdi-microsoft-excel me-1"></i>Export Existing Excel</a></div></div>
<div class="mc-filterbar"><div class="mc-filter-field"><label class="mc-filter-label">Month</label><input id="mMonth" type="month" class="form-control" value="{{ now()->format('Y-m') }}"></div><button id="mApply" class="btn btn-primary">Generate</button></div>
<div class="mc-stat-grid"><div class="mc-stat-card"><div class="mc-stat-label">Monthly Portions</div><div id="mTotal" class="mc-stat-value">—</div><div class="mc-stat-meta">All sessions</div></div><div class="mc-stat-card is-success"><div class="mc-stat-label">Breakfast</div><div id="mBreakfast" class="mc-stat-value">—</div></div><div class="mc-stat-card is-orange"><div class="mc-stat-label">Lunch</div><div id="mLunch" class="mc-stat-value">—</div></div><div class="mc-stat-card is-cyan"><div class="mc-stat-label">Dinner</div><div id="mDinner" class="mc-stat-value">—</div></div></div>
<div class="mc-grid-2"><div class="mc-panel"><div class="mc-panel-head"><div><div class="mc-panel-title">Daily Trend</div><div class="mc-panel-subtitle">Meal portions by date</div></div></div><div class="mc-panel-body"><div id="monthlyChart"></div></div></div><div class="mc-panel"><div class="mc-panel-head"><div><div class="mc-panel-title">Daily Summary</div><div class="mc-panel-subtitle">Compact monthly table</div></div></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="mc-table-modern"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Total</th><th>B</th><th>L</th><th>D</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mBody"></tbody></table></div></div></div>
